# REQUIRES: z3
#
# Validate the complete source/policy/ABI/MLIR/reduction binding before running
# the nonclaimable executable SPS relation reference. The dispatcher owns
# exactly the eight precision-control checkpoints; their ordinary source and
# MLIR-shape checkpoints remain independently owned by the case-local tests.

# RUN: %python %harness/integration/Inputs/run_relation_reference_fixtures.py --checkpoint-pipeline relation-reference --root %harness --records %t.checkpoints --outputs %t.outputs --z3 %z3
# RUN: %checkpoint-runner finalize --test integration/relation-reference-fixtures.test --records %t.checkpoints
